// Vector attributes are NOT loaded by a loading job.
//
// TO VECTOR ATTRIBUTE is valid GSQL and the job is accepted, but running it
// through the REST file-upload endpoint fails with
//   REST-10005 "GetResult index out of range ... response_datas_.size(): 0"
// on any size of file, including a 27-row one, so it is not a size limit.
//
// scripts/load_graph.py loads the embeddings through the REST upsert path
// instead, which accepts a vector attribute directly and is verified by a
// read-back and a vectorSearch in scripts/verify_graph.py.
